ing meals to patients, turning and ambulating patients and providing plenty of fresh water, as well as extra nourishment between meals</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Help patients with personal hygiene. Provide patients with bedpans, help with baths, shampoos and showers and document such</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Provide adjunct care for the patient, including ice packs, non-sterile dressings and therapeutic baths</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Check vital signs and record daily information in the patient&rsquo;s chart</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Assist the nurses and other staff as needed</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: black; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Adhere to professi