  {
    "title": "Physical Therapy Assistant",
    "company": "Essential Healthcare Management",
    "location": "West Haven, Connecticut",
    "salary": "",
    "job_type": "",
    "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Part-time Physical Therapy Assistant/PTA available at West Haven Center</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">for Nursing and Rehab!</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Located at</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #202124; font-family: Roboto, arial, sans-serif;\">310 Terrace Ave, West Haven, CT 06516</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Our approach is patient-centered. With specialty practitioners, therapists, nurses and staff, we have the some of the best programs in the area and we would love for you to join our team!</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Responsibilities:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Identify and meet patients&rsquo; goals and needs</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Offer cost-effective treatments that help improve clients&rsquo; motion and mobility</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Reduce the need for medications and provide alternatives to surgery</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Develop care plans using a variety of treatment techniques</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Create fitness- and wellness-oriented programs tailored to patients&rsquo; specific needs</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Provide quality, personalized and evidence-based care and proven interventions</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Motivate patients during treatment in order to help them function optimally</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Promote clients&rsquo; healthy lifestyle by improving strength, flexibility, balance, and coordination</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Consult and practice with other health professionals</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Evaluate effects and monitor and communicate progress</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Document patient care services</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Skills:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Proven work experience/background as a physical therapist/assistant</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Intensive education and clinical expertise</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Ability to manage patients with different types of personalities</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Current knowledge of treatment practices</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Drive to continually learn and grow</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Professional behavior</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Excellent interpersonal communication skills</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Valid license to practice physical therapy</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Associates Degree for assistant position</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Career Advantages:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Practice in an environment built on integrity and progressive, ethical care</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\"><strong>In-House Therapy Dept- Not Contracted!&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Clinical expertise and training available</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Net Health Electronic documentation system</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Work collaboratively with a supportive team of therapists and nursing staff</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">We are looking for professional Physical Therapist Assistants who are committed to our values and to our mission of striving to improve health and enrich lives through partnership, compassion and acts of kindness, every person, every time. If you want to work in a rewarding environment with the opportunity for personal and professional growth, come join our team</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
